    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always felt a deep connection to mathematics, especially during my upper secondary studies. It’s not just about numbers—it’s logical, structured, and beautiful. I enjoy solving problems, seeing patterns, and understanding how things work. Even though I didn’t pursue it beyond that level, I still find it fascinating and reassuring in everyday life, like in cooking or budgeting.",
